2404/t20240416_2018086.htm", "docreltime": "2024.03.08 11:05:00", "doctitle": "关于印发《三明市文旅康养产业链“延链补链强链”暨市重点文旅项目2024年工作实施方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2191706, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/t20240416_2018086.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2018087, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/t20240416_2018087.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n　　《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展若干措施》已经市政府常务会议研究同意，现印发给你们，请认真抓好贯彻落实。\n　　三明市人民政府办公室\n　　2023年12月29日\n　　三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/t20240416_2018087.htm", "docreltime": "2024.02.16 16:48:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发促进电子商务产业加快发展若干措施的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2191707, "sourcename": "市商务局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/t20240416_2018087.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "电商4.ofd", "appdocid": 2018087, "appfile": "P020240416605810649323.ofd", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/t20240416_2018087.htm", "fileext": "ofd", "_src": "/protect/P0202404/P020240416/P020240416605810649323.ofd", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/P020240416605810649323.ofd"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1999319, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240201_1999319.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，全市金融监管部门联合出台13条助力“开门红”措施，有效发挥金融在提升经济活力、改善社会预期等方面作用，切实巩固和增强经济回升向好态势，力争一季度全市各项贷款增量达到90亿元以上，助力全市经济工作", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240201_1999319.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.30 11:47:00", "doctitle": "媒体报道：全市金融监管部门联合出台 13条措施助力“开门红”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2229452, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240201_1999319.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1993923, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202401/t20240112_1993923.htm", "content": "\n　　一、出台背景\n　　近年来,我市电子商务稳步发展，但是与沿海先进地市相比，我市电子商务还存在着龙头电商企业少、网络零售额增速不快、电商企业纳统数额低等问题，亟需出台适合三明山区地市的电商产业发展政策。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202401/t20240112_1993923.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.29 14:49:00", "doctitle": "关于《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展措施》的政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2229449, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202401/t20240112_1993923.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202401/", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1995995, "docid2": 1993923, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202401/t20240112_1993923.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2023-12-29 14:49:00", "srcdoctitle": "关于《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展措施》的政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/202401/t20240119_1995995.htm", "tardocreltime": "2023-12-29 15:21:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发促进电子商务产业加快发展若干措施的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 2003276, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240223_2003276.htm", "content": "\n　　一、出台背景\n　　近年来,我市电子商务稳步发展，但是与沿海先进地市相比，我市电子商务还存在着龙头电商企业少、网络零售额增速不快、电商企业纳统数额低等问题，亟需出台适合三明山区地市的电商产业发展政策。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240223_2003276.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.29 14:49:00", "doctitle": "动漫解读：关于《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展措施》的政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2229448, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240223_2003276.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "关于《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展措施》.mp4", "appdocid": 2003276, "appfile": "P020240223583371689196.mp4", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240223_2003276.htm", "fileext": "mp4", "_src": "/protect/P0202402/P020240223/P020240223583371689196.mp4", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/P020240223583371689196.mp4"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1995995, "docid2": 2003276, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202402/t20240223_2003276.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2023-12-29 14:49:00", "srcdoctitle": "动漫解读：关于《三明市促进电子商务产业加快发展措施》的政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/202401/t20240119_1995995.htm", "tardocreltime": "2023-12-29 15:21:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发促进电子商务产业加快发展若干措施的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1960456, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960456.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局、总工会：\n　　现将《三明市2023年上海职工入明疗休养优惠政策》印发给你们，请组织辖区内职工疗休养基地、景区、旅行社认真学习、抓好落实。\n　　三明市文化和旅游局           三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960456.htm", "docreltime": "2023.10.07 15:22:00", "doctitle": "三明市文化和旅游局 三明市总工会关于印发2023年上海职工入明疗休养优惠政策的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122324, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960456.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960441, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960441.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局：\n　　现将《2023年三明市旅行社地接奖励办法》印发给你们，请组织辖区内旅行社认真学习，充分调动地接社招徕客源的积极性，全力拓展旅游客源市场，做旺旅游人气，推动我市文旅产业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960441.htm", "docreltime": "2023.10.07 15:15:00", "doctitle": "三明市文化和旅游局关于印发 《2023年三明市旅行社地接奖励办法》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122307, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960441.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960290, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960290.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）民政局、教育局、财政局人力资源和社会保障局：\n　　为鼓励和吸引更多优秀人才从事养老护理工作，根据《福建省养老服务条例》《三明市人民政府办公室关于印发推动老龄事业产业高质量发展十九条措", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960290.htm", "docreltime": "2023.10.07 10:40:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局 三明市教育局 三明市财政局 三明市人力资源和社会保障局关于印发《三明市养老护理人员入职和在职补贴实施办法》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122136, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960290.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960214, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960214.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步规范民宿经营行为，提升管理和服务水平，促进我 市民宿产业持续健康发展，根据文化和旅游部、公安部、自然资源部等十部委联合印发《关于促进乡村民宿高质量发展的指导意见》（文旅市场发〔2022〕77号）", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960214.htm", "docreltime": "2023.10.07 09:50:00", "doctitle": "三明市促进民宿发展若干意见", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122051, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960214.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960317, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960317.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）委人才办、卫健局、财政局、人社局，市直医疗卫生健康单位：\n　　根据《中共三明市委人才工作领导小组关于印发<三明市实施新时代人才强市战略推进“2+3+N”人才专项行动方案>的通知》（明委人才〔2022", "docabstract": "医疗人才补助、柔性引才补助", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960317.htm", "docreltime": "2023.08.31 16:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市卫生健康委员会等4部门关于印发 《三明市医疗人才补助发放实施细则》、《三明市公立医疗卫生机构柔性引才补助发放实施细则》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "明卫〔2023〕63号", "idxid": "SM00123-0200-2023-00015", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2023.08.31 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市卫生健康委员会", "recid": 2122166, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委人事科", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960317.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件  三明市医疗人才补助申请表.doc", "appdocid": 1960317, "appfile": "P020231007397080298218.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960317.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202310/P020231007/P020231007397080298218.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/P020231007397080298218.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960198, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960198.htm", "content": "\n　　明建规〔2023〕3号\n　　三元区人民政府，各相关单位：\n　　为深入贯彻党的二十大关于加快建立多主体供给、多渠道保障、租购并举的住房制度的精神，促进房地产市场平稳健康发展，经市政府同意，现就《关于支持三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960198.htm", "docreltime": "2023.07.20 16:54:00", "doctitle": "关于支持三元区房地产市场平稳健康发展政策措施的补充通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122029, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960198.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1960185, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策/解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960185.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实中央和省上关于扩大内需的战略部署，落实落细市委市政府关于促进消费的工作要求，根据省商务厅等四部门《关于印发福建省 2023 年扩消费八大行动方案的通知》（闽商务〔2023〕35 号）和省商务厅、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/qlhscwxf/zc/202310/t20231007_1960185.htm", "docreltime": "2023.05.16 09:31:00", "doctitle": "2023年“全闽乐购·乐购三明”促消费提升十大行动方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2122014, "sourcename": "三明市商务局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": 